1
00:00:11,400 --> 00:00:15,400
One morning, you see a number above your head.

2
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,400
17,412.

3
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:29,400
Days left.

4
00:00:31,500 --> 00:00:35,600
Everyone has one.

5
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:40,400
Some are big.

6
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:45,400
Some are not.

7
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:54,400
"17,000 days. Plenty of time."

8
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:03,400
So you spend them like you always did.

9
00:01:07,600 --> 00:01:11,400
Mom calls. "Later."

10
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:16,400
Then one Sunday, you finally went home.

11
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,400
She was so happy to see you.

12
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:31,400
And then you saw her number.

13
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:36,400
214.

14
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:45,600
That's 30 Sundays.

15
00:01:46,200 --> 00:01:50,400
30 Sunday dinners. If you come.

16
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:00,400
You had thousands of days.

17
00:02:01,800 --> 00:02:05,400
She had 214.

18
00:02:06,800 --> 00:02:10,400
So you changed everything.

19
00:02:12,500 --> 00:02:20,000
Every Sunday at her table.

20
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:30,000
She taught you her recipes.

21
00:02:32,500 --> 00:02:40,000
You asked about her life.

22
00:02:42,500 --> 00:02:49,400
On the days you couldn't come, you called.

23
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:59,000
You stopped counting your days.

24
00:03:01,500 --> 00:03:09,000
You started making them count.

25
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:21,400
And when her number reached zero...

26
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:33,400
...you had no regrets.

27
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:40,400
Only memories.

28
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:46,600
You can't see your number.

29
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:52,400
But it's counting.

30
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:58,400
Everyone you love has a number.

31
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:04,400
Don't wait to see it.

32
00:04:06,000 --> 00:04:11,200
Call them today.

